# Local artefacts and credentials — belt and braces ONLY.
# The real protection is outside .gitignore: the client refuses to read a
# credential (the Internal API token) from a path inside this repository tree
# (CREDENTIAL_IN_REPO, exit code 23). See README.md, "Security model".
node_modules/
test-results/
*.log
.env
.env.*
*.token
internal-api-token*
*.sock
